sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant API
    participant Compiler
    participant PostgreSQL
    Manager->>API: Publish with expected revision and idempotency key
    API->>PostgreSQL: Verify command receipt and lock definition
    API->>Compiler: Validate XSD and executable semantics
    alt valid draft and active groups
      API->>PostgreSQL: Insert version, update active pointer, save audit and receipt
      API-->>Manager: 201 with version ID
    else invalid or stale
      API-->>Manager: 409 or 422 with details
    end
